            "name": "query - Security Incident Summary"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🚨 Security Incident Summary\n\nProvides a workspace-level view of Microsoft Sentinel incidents across the selected workspaces.\n\nIncident counts use the **latest known state of each incident** and include incidents **created during the selected Time Range**. The global **Severity, Product and Owner** selections are applied to this view.\n\n- **Customer** — Customer context resolved from Azure Lighthouse where a matching workspace delegation is available; otherwise the full Azure subscription name is shown.\n- **Lighthouse** — **Yes** means a Lighthouse delegation was found that directly covers the Sentinel workspace subscription or resource group. **Unknown** means a matching delegation could not be established from the available Azure Resource Graph data; it does not mean that no Lighthouse relationship exists for the customer.\n- **P1–P4** — Incident counts by Microsoft Sentinel severity.\n- **Total** — Total incidents in the selected incident population.\n- **Last Incident** — Time since the most recently created incident in the selected period.\n- **Median First Action** — Median time from incident creation to its first recorded modification.\n- **Median Close** — Median time from incident creation to closure for closed incidents.\n- **Incident Trend** — Incident creation activity across the selected Time Range.\n\n💡 **Customer and Lighthouse describe different things.** Customer identifies the environment using the best available context. Lighthouse indicates whether the **Sentinel workspace itself** can be matched to a direct Lighthouse delegation. A customer can therefore have a Lighthouse relationship elsewhere while this column shows **Unknown**."
            },
            "name": "text - 11"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.insights/workbooks\"\r\n| where properties.displayName has \"Security operations efficiency\"\r\n| project\r\n    id,\r\n    note = \"Subscription and Workspace may need to be selected again in the opened workbook.\"\r\n| limit 1",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "Open [Security Operations Efficiency] Workbook - if the Workbook exists locally?",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ]
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "exportworkSpacename",
              "comparison": "isNotEqualTo"
            },
            "name": "query - open_SOC_workbook"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces\"\r\n| project\r\n    id,\r\n    name = tolower(name),\r\n    subscriptionId,\r\n    tenantId,\r\n    resourceGroup\r\n| join kind=inner\r\n(\r\n    resources\r\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.operationsmanagement/solutions\"\r\n    | where name has \"SecurityInsights\"\r\n    | parse name with * \"(\" SentinelWorkspace \")\" *\r\n    | project name = tolower(SentinelWorkspace), location\r\n)\r\non name\r\n| where name =~ \"{exportworkSpacename}\"\r\n| project\r\n    name,\r\n    Region = location,\r\n    resourceGroup,\r\n    subscriptionId,\r\n    tenantId,\r\n    Open = tolower(id)",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "🏢 Workspace Details — {exportworkSpacename}",
              "exportedParameters": [
                {
                  "fieldName": "tenantId",
                  "parameterName": "exporttenantId",
                  "parameterType": 1
                },
                {
                  "fieldName": "subscriptionId",
                  "parameterName": "exportSubscriptionId",
                  "parameterType": 1
                },
                {
                  "fieldName": "resourceGroup",
                  "parameterName": "exportResourceGroup",
                  "parameterType": 1
                },
                {
                  "fieldName": "name",
                  "parameterName": "exportName",
                  "parameterType": 1
                }
              ],
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ]
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "exportworkSpacename",
              "comparison": "isNotEqualTo"
            },
            "name": "query - Workspace Details"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "{\"version\":\"ARMEndpoint/1.0\",\"data\":null,\"headers\":[],\"method\":\"GET\",\"path\":\"/tenants\",\"urlParams\":[{\"key\":\"api-version\",\"value\":\"2022-12-01\"}],\"batchDisabled\":false,\"transformers\":[{\"type\":\"jsonpath\",\"settings\":{\"tablePath\":\"$.value\",\"columns\":[{\"path\":\"$.id\",\"columnid\":\"id\"},{\"path\":\"$.tenantId\",\"columnid\":\"tenantId\"},{\"path\":\"$.displayName\",\"columnid\":\"displayName\"},{\"path\":\"$.defaultDomain\",\"columnid\":\"defaultDomain\"},{\"path\":\"$.countryCode\",\"columnid\":\"countryCode\"},{\"path\":\"$.tenantType\",\"columnid\":\"tenantType\"},{\"path\":\"$.tenantCategory\",\"columnid\":\"tenantCategory\"},{\"path\":\"$.domains\",\"columnid\":\"domains\"},{\"path\":\"$.tenantBrandingLogoUrl\",\"columnid\":\"tenantBrandingLogoUrl\"}]}}]}",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "🏢 Accessible Tenant Directory — {$rowCount} tenants",
              "queryType": 12
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "exportworkSpacename",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "hide"
            },
            "name": "query - Tenant Details"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "{\"version\":\"ARMEndpoint/1.0\",\"data\":null,\"headers\":[],\"method\":\"GET\",\"path\":\"/subscriptions/{exportSubscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{exportResourceGroup}/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/{exportworkSpacename}/providers/Microsoft.SecurityInsights/alertRules\",\"urlParams\":[{\"key\":\"api-version\",\"value\":\"2024-03-01\"}],\"batchDisabled\":false,\"transformers\":[{\"type\":\"jsonpath\",\"settings\":{\"tablePath\":\"$.value\",\"columns\":[]}}]}",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "📐 Analytics Rules — {exportworkSpacename} — {$rowCount} deployed",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 12
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "exportworkSpacename",
              "comparison": "isNotEqualTo",
              "value": ""
            },
            "name": "query - Rules details"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "{\"version\":\"Merge/1.0\",\"merges\":[{\"id\":\"724f0ff2-e293-4655-9005-b25c4442a0de\",\"mergeType\":\"leftouter\",\"leftTable\":\"query - Workspace Details\",\"rightTable\":\"query - Tenant Details\",\"leftColumn\":\"tenantId\",\"rightColumn\":\"tenantId\"}],\"projectRename\":[{\"originalName\":\"[query - Workspace Details].name\",\"mergedName\":\"name\",\"fromId\":\"unknown\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Workspace Details].Region\",\"mergedName\":\"Region\",\"fromId\":\"unknown\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Workspace Details].resourceGroup\",\"mergedName\":\"resourceGroup\",\"fromId\":\"unknown\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Workspace Details].subscriptionId\",\"mergedName\":\"subscriptionId\",\"fromId\":\"unknown\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Workspace Details].Open\",\"mergedName\":\"Open\",\"fromId\":\"unknown\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Tenant Details].id\",\"mergedName\":\"id\",\"fromId\":\"unknown\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Tenant Details].tenantId\",\"mergedName\":\"tenantId\",\"fromId\":\"unknown\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Tenant Details].tenantBrandingLogoUrl\",\"mergedName\":\"tenantBrandingLogoUrl\",\"fromId\":\"unknown\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Workspace Details].tenantId\",\"mergedName\":\"Tenant ID\",\"fromId\":\"724f0ff2-e293-4655-9005-b25c4442a0de\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Tenant Details].displayName\",\"mergedName\":\"Tenant\",\"fromId\":\"724f0ff2-e293-4655-9005-b25c4442a0de\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Tenant Details].defaultDomain\",\"mergedName\":\"Default Domain\",\"fromId\":\"724f0ff2-e293-4655-9005-b25c4442a0de\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Tenant Details].countryCode\",\"mergedName\":\"Country\",\"fromId\":\"724f0ff2-e293-4655-9005-b25c4442a0de\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Tenant Details].tenantType\",\"mergedName\":\"Tenant Type\",\"fromId\":\"724f0ff2-e293-4655-9005-b25c4442a0de\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Tenant Details].tenantCategory\",\"mergedName\":\"Category\",\"fromId\":\"724f0ff2-e293-4655-9005-b25c4442a0de\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Tenant Details].domains\",\"mergedName\":\"Domains\",\"fromId\":\"724f0ff2-e293-4655-9005-b25c4442a0de\"}]}",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "🏢 Tenant Details",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 7
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "exportworkSpacename",
              "comparison": "isNotEqualTo"
            },
            "name": "query - Tenant Context"
          }
        ]
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "incidents"
      },
      "name": "group - overview"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---------------"
      },
      "name": "text - 9"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "title": "🔎 Incident Details",
        "expandable": true,
        "expanded": true,
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "SecurityIncident\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// WORKSPACE NAME\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend stringtoSplit = split(\"{WorkspaceIDguid}\", \",\")\r\n| mv-expand stringtoSplit\r\n| where stringtoSplit has TenantId\r\n| extend Workspace =\r\n    trim(\r\n        @\"[^\\w]+\",\r\n        tostring(split(stringtoSplit, \":\").[1])\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// LATEST INCIDENT STATE\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| summarize\r\n    arg_max(TimeGenerated, *)\r\n    by TenantId, IncidentNumber\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// PRODUCT\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend ProductName =\r\n    tostring(\r\n        parse_json(\r\n            tostring(AdditionalData.alertProductNames)\r\n        )[0]\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| where \"All\" in ({Product})\r\n    or ProductName in ({Product})\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// OWNER\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend OwnerName =\r\n    coalesce(\r\n        tostring(Owner.assignedTo),\r\n        tostring(Owner.email),\r\n        \"Unassigned\"\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend OwnerName =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(OwnerName),\r\n        \"Unassigned\",\r\n        OwnerName\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY SEVERITY\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend SeverityDisplay =\r\n    case(\r\n        Severity == \"High\",          \"🔴 P1 - High\",\r\n        Severity == \"Medium\",        \"🟠 P2 - Medium\",\r\n        Severity == \"Low\",           \"🟡 P3 - Low\",\r\n        Severity == \"Informational\", \"🔵 P4 - Informational\",\r\n        Severity\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY STATUS\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend StatusDisplay =\r\n    case(\r\n        Status == \"New\",    \"🆕 New\",\r\n        Status == \"Active\", \"🔄 Active\",\r\n        Status == \"Closed\", \"✅ Closed\",\r\n        Status\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SORT\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| order by Workspace asc, IncidentNumber desc\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FINAL OPERATIONAL VIEW\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Workspace,\r\n    IncidentNumber,\r\n    Severity = SeverityDisplay,\r\n    Status = StatusDisplay,\r\n    Title,\r\n    Owner = OwnerName,\r\n    Product = ProductName,\r\n    [\"Last Modified\"] = LastModifiedTime,\r\n    Open = IncidentUrl",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🚨 {$rowCount} Incidents across selected Workspaces — {TimeRange:label}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "exportedParameters": [
                {
                  "fieldName": "IncidentNumber",
                  "parameterName": "IncidentNumber",
                  "parameterType": 1
                },
                {
                  "fieldName": "Workspace",
                  "parameterName": "Workspace_export",
                  "parameterType": 1
                }
              ],
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "$gen_group",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "35ch"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Workspace",
                    "formatter": 5
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Severity",
                    "formatter": 5
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Open",
                    "formatter": 7,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "Url",
                      "linkLabel": "Open in Microsoft Sentinel"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 5000,
                "filter": true,
                "hierarchySettings": {
                  "treeType": 1,
                  "groupBy": [
                    "Workspace",
                    "Severity"
                  ],
                  "expandTopLevel": true
                },
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "IncidentNumber",
                    "label": "Incident #"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "sortBy": []
            },
            "name": "query - multi Alerts"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "💡 Results are grouped by Workspace → Severity. The number shown beside a Workspace is the number of severity groups present, not the number of incidents. The number beside each Severity is the incident count."
            },
            "name": "text - Incident Grouping Guidance"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "For further analysis, open the incident directly in Microsoft Sentinel using the link in the table above. If Investigation workbooks have previously been saved in the selected workspace, selecting an incident row can also surface matching Investigation workbooks."
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "text - Incident Investigation Guidance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\r\n| where type == \"microsoft.insights/workbooks\"\r\n| where properties.displayName has \"Investigation\"\r\n| where properties.displayName has \"{Workspace_export}\"\r\n| project\r\n    WorkbookName = tostring(properties.displayName),\r\n    id,\r\n    IncidentNumber = \"{IncidentNumber}\"",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "Investigation Workbooks — {Workspace_export} — Incident {IncidentNumber}",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "id",
                    "formatter": 7,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "WorkbookTemplate",
                      "linkLabel": "Open Workbook",
                      "linkIsContextBlade": true
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "WorkbookName",
                    "label": "Workbook Name"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "id",
                    "label": "Open"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "IncidentNumber",
                    "label": "Incident Number"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "Workspace_export",
              "comparison": "isNotEqualTo",
              "value": ""
            },
            "name": "query - Incident Workspace Context"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Select a single workspace to see incident-level details"
            },
            "name": "text - Single Workspace Heading"
          },
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "4383a3f4-7606-41a7-b1cf-e5bffd2d9ecb",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "iWorkspace",
                  "label": "🚨 Incident Workspace",
                  "type": 2,
                  "description": "Select a workspace from the active global Workspace scope",
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "query": "resources\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces\"\r\n| project value = name, label = name\r\n| order by label asc",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "{Workspace}"
                  ],
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "queryType": 1,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
                  "value": ""
                },
                {
                  "id": "incident-workspace-resource-id",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "iWorkspaceResourceId",
                  "label": "Incident Workspace Resource ID",
                  "type": 1,
                  "query": "resources\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces\"\r\n| where tolower(name) == tolower(\"{iWorkspace}\")\r\n| project id\r\n| take 1",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "{Workspace}"
                  ],
                  "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
                  "queryType": 1,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
                },
                {
                  "id": "c2494755-05cc-4b93-b253-e8a0d4b7c899",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "iResourceGroup",
                  "label": "Incident Resource Group",
                  "type": 1,
                  "query": "resources\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces\"\r\n| where tolower(name) == tolower(\"{iWorkspace}\")\r\n| project resourceGroup\r\n| take 1",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "{Workspace}"
                  ],
                  "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
                  "queryType": 1,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
                }
              ],
              "style": "above",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
            },
            "customWidth": "20",
            "name": "parameters - Incident Workspace"
          },
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "93c9035c-b33a-4a33-a976-9507a04d908e",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "selectSeverity",
                  "label": "🎚️ Severity",
                  "type": 2,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "'",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "query": "SecurityIncident\r\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by IncidentNumber\r\n| parse IncidentUrl with * \"/workspaces/\" IncidentWorkspace \"/\" *\r\n| where tolower(IncidentWorkspace) == tolower(\"{iWorkspace}\")\r\n| where CreatedTime >= {TimeRange:start}\r\n    and CreatedTime <= {TimeRange:end}\r\n| summarize Count = count() by Severity\r\n| extend SeverityOrder = case(\r\n    Severity == \"High\", 1,\r\n    Severity == \"Medium\", 2,\r\n    Severity == \"Low\", 3,\r\n    Severity == \"Informational\", 4,\r\n    5\r\n)\r\n| extend Label = case(\r\n    Severity == \"High\", strcat(\"🔴 P1 - High (\", Count, \")\"),\r\n    Severity == \"Medium\", strcat(\"🟠 P2 - Medium (\", Count, \")\"),\r\n    Severity == \"Low\", strcat(\"🟡 P3 - Low (\", Count, \")\"),\r\n    Severity == \"Informational\", strcat(\"🔵 P4 - Informational (\", Count, \")\"),\r\n    strcat(Severity, \" (\", Count, \")\")\r\n)\r\n| project Value = Severity, Label, SeverityOrder\r\n| order by SeverityOrder asc\r\n| project Value, Label",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "{Workspace}"
                  ],
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [
                      "value::all"
                    ],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 0
                  },
                  "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
                  "defaultValue": "value::all",
                  "queryType": 0,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                  "value": [
                    "value::all"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "069e318c-ff99-4044-a06e-af9c22a1ce89",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "selectStatus",
                  "label": "📌 Status",
                  "type": 2,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "'",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "query": "SecurityIncident\r\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by IncidentNumber\r\n| parse IncidentUrl with * \"/workspaces/\" IncidentWorkspace \"/\" *\r\n| where tolower(IncidentWorkspace) == tolower(\"{iWorkspace}\")\r\n| where CreatedTime >= {TimeRange:start}\r\n    and CreatedTime <= {TimeRange:end}\r\n| summarize Count = count() by Status\r\n| extend StatusOrder = case(\r\n    Status == \"New\", 1,\r\n    Status == \"Active\", 2,\r\n    Status == \"Closed\", 3,\r\n    4\r\n)\r\n| extend Label = case(\r\n    Status == \"New\", strcat(\"🆕 New (\", Count, \")\"),\r\n    Status == \"Active\", strcat(\"🔄 Active (\", Count, \")\"),\r\n    Status == \"Closed\", strcat(\"✅ Closed (\", Count, \")\"),\r\n    strcat(Status, \" (\", Count, \")\")\r\n)\r\n| project Value = Status, Label, StatusOrder\r\n| order by StatusOrder asc\r\n| project Value, Label",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "{Workspace}"
                  ],
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [
                      "value::all"
                    ],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 0
                  },
                  "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
                  "defaultValue": "value::all",
                  "queryType": 0,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                  "value": [
                    "value::all"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "dc578da6-0268-483c-a77c-eb126f4d116b",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "total",
                  "label": "Incident Total",
                  "type": 1,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "query": "SecurityIncident\r\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by IncidentNumber\r\n| parse IncidentUrl with * \"/workspaces/\" IncidentWorkspace \"/\" *\r\n| where tolower(IncidentWorkspace) == tolower(\"{iWorkspace}\")\r\n| where CreatedTime >= {TimeRange:start}\r\n    and CreatedTime <= {TimeRange:end}\r\n| where \"*\" in ({selectSeverity}) or Severity in ({selectSeverity})\r\n| where \"*\" in ({selectStatus}) or Status in ({selectStatus})\r\n| summarize IncidentTotal = count()\r\n| project value = tostring(IncidentTotal)",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "{Workspace}"
                  ],
                  "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 0
                  },
                  "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
                  "queryType": 0,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
                }
              ],
              "style": "above",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
            },
            "customWidth": "25",
            "name": "parameters - Incident Detail Filters"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "🔎 **Incident Details** — Select a workspace for incident-level investigation. Severity and Status filters apply to this detailed view. Open an incident directly in Microsoft Sentinel for further investigation."
            },
            "name": "text - Incident Details Guidance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ======================================================================\r\n// Sentinel Central - Single Workspace Incident Details\r\n//\r\n// Shows the latest state of incidents created during the selected\r\n// Time Range for the selected Incident Workspace.\r\n// ======================================================================\r\n\r\nSecurityIncident\r\n\r\n| summarize\r\n    arg_max(TimeGenerated, *)\r\n    by IncidentNumber\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// INCIDENT WORKSPACE\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| parse IncidentUrl with * \"/workspaces/\" IncidentWorkspace \"/\" *\r\n| where tolower(IncidentWorkspace) == tolower(\"{iWorkspace}\")\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// TIME RANGE\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| where CreatedTime >= {TimeRange:start}\r\n    and CreatedTime <= {TimeRange:end}\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// PRODUCT\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend ProductName =\r\n    tostring(\r\n        parse_json(\r\n            tostring(AdditionalData.alertProductNames)\r\n        )[0]\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| where \"All\" in ({Product})\r\n    or ProductName in ({Product})\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SEVERITY\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| where \"*\" in ({selectSeverity})\r\n    or Severity in ({selectSeverity})\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// STATUS\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| where \"*\" in ({selectStatus})\r\n    or Status in ({selectStatus})\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// OWNER\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend OwnerName =\r\n    coalesce(\r\n        tostring(Owner.assignedTo),\r\n        tostring(Owner.email),\r\n        \"Unassigned\"\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend OwnerName =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(OwnerName),\r\n        \"Unassigned\",\r\n        OwnerName\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| where \"All\" in ({Owner})\r\n    or OwnerName in ({Owner})\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// ALERT COUNT\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend AlertIdsDyn = todynamic(AlertIds)\r\n\r\n| extend AlertCount =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isnull(AlertIdsDyn),\r\n        0,\r\n        array_length(AlertIdsDyn)\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// MITRE ATT&CK\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend Tactics = todynamic(AdditionalData.tactics)\r\n| extend Techniques = todynamic(AdditionalData.techniques)\r\n| extend SubTechniques = todynamic(AdditionalData.subTechniques)\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// LABELS / COMMENTS\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend Tags = tostring(Labels)\r\n| extend IncidentComments = tostring(Comments)\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY SEVERITY\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend SeverityDisplay =\r\n    case(\r\n        Severity == \"High\",          \"🔴 P1 - High\",\r\n        Severity == \"Medium\",        \"🟠 P2 - Medium\",\r\n        Severity == \"Low\",           \"🟡 P3 - Low\",\r\n        Severity == \"Informational\", \"🔵 P4 - Informational\",\r\n        Severity\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY STATUS\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend StatusDisplay =\r\n    case(\r\n        Status == \"New\",    \"🆕 New\",\r\n        Status == \"Active\", \"🔄 Active\",\r\n        Status == \"Closed\", \"✅ Closed\",\r\n        Status\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FINAL OUTPUT\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    [\"Incident #\"] = IncidentNumber,\r\n    Severity = SeverityDisplay,\r\n    Status = StatusDisplay,\r\n    Title,\r\n    Owner = OwnerName,\r\n    Product = ProductName,\r\n    Alerts = AlertCount,\r\n    Created = CreatedTime,\r\n    [\"Last Modified\"] = LastModifiedTime,\r\n    Classification,\r\n    Open = IncidentUrl,\r\n    [\"First Modified\"] = FirstModifiedTime,\r\n    Closed = ClosedTime,\r\n    [\"Classification Reason\"] = ClassificationReason,\r\n    [\"Classification Comment\"] = ClassificationComment,\r\n    Tactics,\r\n    Techniques,\r\n    [\"Sub-Techniques\"] = SubTechniques,\r\n    Tags,\r\n    Comments = IncidentComments,\r\n    [\"Modified By\"] = ModifiedBy,\r\n    Provider = ProviderName,\r\n    Description\r\n\r\n| order by [\"Incident #\"] desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🚨 Incident Details — {iWorkspace} — {$rowCount} Incidents — {TimeRange:label}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Alerts",
                    "formatter": 8,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "whiteBlack"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Open",
                    "formatter": 1,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "Url",
                      "linkLabel": "Open in Microsoft Sentinel"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Classification Comment",
                    "formatter": 7,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "CellDetails",
                      "linkIsContextBlade": true
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Tags",
                    "formatter": 7,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "CellDetails",
                      "linkIsContextBlade": true
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Comments",
                    "formatter": 7,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "CellDetails",
                      "linkIsContextBlade": true
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Description",
                    "formatter": 7,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "CellDetails",
                      "linkIsContextBlade": true
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 2000,
                "filter": true,
                "sortBy": [
                  {
                    "itemKey": "Status",
                    "sortOrder": 2
                  }
                ]
              },
              "sortBy": [
                {
                  "itemKey": "Status",
                  "sortOrder": 2
                }
              ]
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "iWorkspace",
              "comparison": "isNotEqualTo",
              "value": ""
            },
            "name": "query - Incident Details"
          }
        ]
